{
  "slug": "spec-ark",
  "name": "Spec Ark",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "SpecArk: artifact-driven Development using  SPDD workflows for Claude Code \n\nstory → analysis → prompt → code, with file-backed handoffs and traceability.\n\nIt helps development teams produce healthy code while collaborating on specifications, artifacts. Fast and easy with a strong focus on UX/UI as a native plugin.",
  "longDescription": "Installs with `claude plugin install spec-ark@claude-community` from `maxgda/spec-ark`.\n\nStructured Prompt-Driven Development, packaged as a Git-distributed plugin bundle for Codex, Claude Code, and Claude Cowork.\n\nSpecArk: artifact-driven Development using  SPDD workflows for Claude Code \n\nstory → analysis → prompt → code, with file-backed handoffs and traceability.\n\nIt helps development teams produce healthy code while collaborating on specifications, artifacts. Fast and easy with a strong focus on UX/UI as a native plugin.",
